# This importer's Dockerfile uses `COPY . .`, so without this file the image
# contained `tests/`, `.pytest_cache/` and -- on a developer machine -- the whole
# local `.venv/`, which also shadowed the interpreter's own site-packages.
.venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
tests
*.egg-info
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
